// Brand logo paths — most sourced from the simple-icons set (24x24 viewBox);
// AI labs simple-icons lacks come from Lobe Icons (MIT), and Factory, Noiz,
// Odyssey, World Labs and Reflection from the SVG favicons on their own sites.
// Recursive's mark is the vector from its site header and Block's is the 3x3
// grid mark from block.xyz, Phonic's from its SVG favicon and ElevenLabs' from
// simple-icons; Krafton's and Nanbeige's are traced from their
// favicon / Hugging Face avatar PNGs (flagged custom), as neither publishes an SVG.
// 01.AI (its Yi mark), AI21, Inflection, TII, Reka, Ai2, Arcee and Snowflake are
// Lobe Icons; Databricks is simple-icons; Sarvam is the SVG favicon on sarvam.ai.
// BigScience's cherry blossom and Ricursive's italic "RI" are our own redraws of
// their avatar / favicon PNGs (flagged custom). Microsoft keeps its four-colour
// squares via `parts`.
// Keyed by companies.json id. Rendered tinted via lib/logos usage sites.
